{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22339","headline":"和元九悼往 · 白居易","name":"和元九悼往","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人别君去，自去无处寻。\n旧物零落尽，此情安可任。\n唯有襭纱幌，尘埃日夜侵。\n馨香与颜色，不似旧时深。\n透影灯耿耿，笼光月沈沈。\n中有孤眠客，秋凉生夜衾。\n旧宅牡丹院，新坟松柏林。\n梦中咸阳泪，觉後江陵心。\n含此隔年恨，发爲中夜吟。\n无论君自感，闻者欲沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}